### 查询该 key 可用的模型清单（先跑这个，确认模型是否已开通）
GET {{baseUrl}}/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 对话
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "{{chatModel}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "你是谁？" }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.test("状态码 200", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "实际状态码: " + response.status);
  });
%}

### ===============================================================
### 向量模型(embedding)测试
### 说明: embedding 与 chat 不是同一组参数(PRD §1.5.1-D1)。
###       若你的 embedding 走独立端点/Key, 把下面两处换成
###       {{embeddingBaseUrl}} / {{embeddingApiKey}}, 并在
###       http-client.private.env.json 里补这两个变量。
### ===============================================================

### 1) 确认模型已开通(能列出模型 = Key 与端点可用)
GET {{baseUrl}}/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 2) 单条向量化 + 维度断言(核心用例: 维度必须是 1024)
POST {{baseUrl}}/embeddings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "qwen3.7-text-embedding-flash",
  "input": ["第一章 总则 贷款利率按 LPR 加点执行"],
  "dimensions": 1024,
  "encoding_format": "float"
}

> {%
  client.test("状态码 200", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200,
      "实际: " + response.status + " body: " + JSON.stringify(response.body));
  });
  const vector = response.body.data[0].embedding;
  client.test("维度 = 1024(与 vector(1024) 对齐)", () => {
    client.assert(vector.length === 1024, "实际维度: " + vector.length);
  });
  client.test("不是全零向量", () => {
    client.assert(vector.some(v => v !== 0), "全零说明没有真正计算");
  });
  client.test("有 token 消耗", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.usage.total_tokens > 0,
      "usage: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.usage));
  });
%}

### 3) 批量向量化(百炼单批上限 20 行; 传 21 条应被拒绝)
POST {{baseUrl}}/embeddings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "qwen3.7-text-embedding-flash",
  "input": [
    "第一章 总则",
    "第二章 授信额度",
    "第三章 利率与费用"
  ],
  "dimensions": 1024
}

> {%
  client.test("三条输入返回三条向量", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.data.length === 3, "实际: " + response.body.data.length);
  });
  client.test("每条都是 1024 维", () => {
    response.body.data.forEach((item, i) => {
      client.assert(item.embedding.length === 1024, "第 " + i + " 条维度: " + item.embedding.length);
    });
  });
%}

### 4) 对照: 不传 dimensions, 确认服务端默认维度是否也是 1024
###    若第 2 步报 "unknown parameter: dimensions", 删掉该行, 以本用例结果为准
POST {{baseUrl}}/embeddings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "qwen3.7-text-embedding-flash",
  "input": ["维度对照测试"]
}

> {%
  client.test("默认维度 = 1024", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.data[0].embedding.length === 1024,
      "实际默认维度: " + response.body.data[0].embedding.length);
  });
%}

### ===============================================================
### 5) 应用内验证: 走 B0 上传, 看切片是否被真正向量化
###    前提: 启动应用时 EMBEDDING_ENABLED=true 且 EMBEDDING_API_KEY 有效
###    上传成功后执行:
###      SELECT doc_id, count(*) FILTER (WHERE embedding IS NOT NULL) AS indexed,
###             count(*) AS total,
###             min(vector_dims(embedding)) AS dim
###      FROM document_chunk WHERE is_current = true GROUP BY doc_id ORDER BY doc_id DESC;
###    期望: indexed = total 且 dim = 1024
### ===============================================================

### 5.1 上传政策文档(返回 chunkCount; embedding 为空说明向量化失败, 见应用日志)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/documents/policy
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="2024年报.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./2024年报.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

> {%
  client.test("切片入库成功", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "实际: " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.data.chunkCount > 0, "chunkCount: " + response.body.data.chunkCount);
  });
%}

### ===============================================================
### C2 向量检索
### 前置: 已有文档完成切片且 embedding 非空(见第 5 段)
### ===============================================================

### 6) 全库检索: 命中项自带 [文档名 p.12-13] 引用
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 5,
  "mode": "HYBRID"
}

> {%
  client.test("命中非空", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.data.length > 0,
      "命中数: " + response.body.data.length + ", 检查切片是否已向量化");
  });
  client.test("每条都带引用", () => {
    response.body.data.forEach((hit, i) => {
      client.assert(/^\[.+\]$/.test(hit.citation), "第 " + i + " 条引用格式异常: " + hit.citation);
    });
  });
  client.test("相似度降序", () => {
    const scores = response.body.data.map(h => h.score);
    const sorted = [...scores].sort((a, b) => b - a);
    client.assert(JSON.stringify(scores) === JSON.stringify(sorted), "分数未降序: " + scores);
  });
%}

### 7) 限定单份文档检索(docId 必填时才加 doc_id 过滤)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "利率 加点",
  "limit": 3,
  "docId": 1
}

### 7.1) 三种模式对比: 同一个 query 分别跑 VECTOR / BM25 / HYBRID
### 注意: HYBRID 返回的 score 是 RRF 融合分(约 0.0x), 与余弦相似度不可比, 只看顺序

### 7.1.1) 纯向量(语义相近)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 5,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "VECTOR"
}

### 7.1.2) 纯词面(BM25, 不需要 embedding Key)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 5,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "BM25"
}

### 7.1.3) 融合(默认; 不传 mode 也是这个行为)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 5,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "HYBRID"
}

> {%
  client.test("融合结果非空", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.data.length > 0,
      "命中数: " + response.body.data.length + ", 先上传政策 PDF 并确认已向量化");
  });
  client.test("每条都带引用", () => {
    response.body.data.forEach((hit, i) => {
      client.assert(/^\[.+\]$/.test(hit.citation), "第 " + i + " 条: " + hit.citation);
    });
  });
%}

### 8) 重新向量化(补偿入口, 幂等: 只处理 embedding IS NULL 的当前切片)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/documents/1/reindex

### ===============================================================
### C4 LLM Rerank(默认关闭)
###
### 前置 1: 启动时 RERANK_ENABLED=true —— 否则 rerank=true 会静默返回原顺序
###         (LlmReranker 里 enabled=false 直接短路, 不发起模型调用)
### 前置 2: chat 模型可用(重排是一次真实的 chat 调用, 不是纯本地计算)
### 前置 3: 库里已有政策文档且切片已向量化(见第 5 段)
###
### 重点: rerank=true 时 score 仍是"召回分"(余弦/RRF), 不再代表重排后的相关性,
###       所以下面**不断言 score 降序**(第 6 段那条断言在这里不成立),
###       只校验 条数 / 引用格式 / "只重排不新增"。
### ===============================================================

### 9.1) 对照组: 不重排, 先宽召回 20 条作为候选池
###      这一步同时把候选 chunkId 存进全局变量, 供 9.2 断言"不新增"
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 20,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "VECTOR",
  "rerank": false
}

> {%
  client.test("候选池非空", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.data.length > 0,
      "命中 0 条: 先上传政策 PDF 并确认已向量化(第 5 段)");
  });
  client.global.set("candidateIds",
    response.body.data.map(h => h.chunkId).join(","));
  client.global.set("baselineTop5",
    response.body.data.slice(0, 5).map(h => h.chunkId).join(","));
  console.log("候选池: " + client.global.get("candidateIds"));
  console.log("原顺序 top5: " + client.global.get("baselineTop5"));
%}

### 9.2) 实验组: VECTOR + rerank, 只取前 5
###      断言核心是"只重排不新增": 返回的每条都必须在本来的 20 条候选池里,
###      模型给出越界编号时 RerankOrderParser 会丢弃, 不可能凭空造出新片段
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 5,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "VECTOR",
  "rerank": true
}

> {%
  client.test("状态码 200(重排失败会降级, 不该 5xx)", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "实际: " + response.status);
  });
  client.test("返回条数 = 5", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.data.length === 5,
      "实际: " + response.body.data.length);
  });
  client.test("只重排不新增: 每条都来自候选池", () => {
    const pool = (client.global.get("candidateIds") || "").split(",").map(Number);
    response.body.data.forEach((hit, i) => {
      client.assert(pool.includes(hit.chunkId),
        "第 " + i + " 条 chunkId=" + hit.chunkId + " 不在候选池, 重排不该引入新片段");
    });
  });
  client.test("仍带引用(重排不影响引用渲染)", () => {
    response.body.data.forEach((hit, i) => {
      client.assert(/^\[.+\]$/.test(hit.citation), "第 " + i + " 条: " + hit.citation);
    });
  });

  const reranked = response.body.data.map(h => h.chunkId).join(",");
  console.log("重排后 top5: " + reranked);
  console.log("与原顺序是否相同: " + (reranked === client.global.get("baselineTop5")));
%}

### 9.3) HYBRID + rerank(验证重排能接在融合之后, 不绑死某一路)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 5,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "HYBRID",
  "rerank": true
}

> {%
  client.test("命中非空", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.data.length > 0, "命中 0 条");
  });
%}

### 9.4) BM25 + rerank(词面路也能重排; 不需要 embedding, 只需 chat)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 5,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "BM25",
  "rerank": true
}

### ===============================================================
### 9.5) 怎么确认"重排真的调了模型", 而不是静默降级
###
### 方式一(看响应头): 第 9.2 段的响应头里有 X-Trace-Id, 拿它查库:
###   SELECT id, kind, model, prompt_tokens, completion_tokens, cost, round_no
###     FROM ai_call_log WHERE trace_id = '<X-Trace-Id>' ORDER BY id;
###   期望: 比 9.1 多出一次 CHAT 调用, prompt_tokens 约 2000~4000
###         (20 条候选 × 200 字截断), completion 只有几十(输出是一小段 JSON)
###
### 方式二(看应用日志, 需 AI_LOG_LEVEL=debug):
###   会多出 LLM_REQ round=1 tools=[none], 且 prompt 里含 "重排器" 与 "[1] [2] ..." 编号
###
### 方式三(对比): 9.2 与 9.1 的原顺序 top5 完全相同, 有两种可能 ——
###   ① RERANK_ENABLED=false(没生效, 先查这个);
###   ② 模型认为原顺序就是最优(正常结果, 不是 bug)。
###   区分办法就是方式一: 没有多出那次 CHAT 调用 = 没生效。
### ===============================================================

### 9.6) 边界: limit=1 + rerank, 重排后只保留第 1 条
###      验证 topN 截断在重排之后生效, 而不是先把候选砍到 1 条再重排(那样重排毫无意义)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "逾期几次算不良",
  "limit": 1,
  "docType": "POLICY_DOC",
  "mode": "VECTOR",
  "rerank": true
}

> {%
  client.test("只返回 1 条", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "实际: " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.data.length === 1,
      "实际: " + response.body.data.length + ", 库里政策切片可能不足");
  });
%}
